---Assign an organization role to a team
---
---Assigns an organization role to a team in an organization. For more information on organization roles, see "[Using organization roles](https://docs.github.com/organizations/managing-peoples-access-to-your-organization-with-roles/using-organization-roles)."
---
---The authenticated user must be an administrator for the organization to use this endpoint.
---
---OAuth app tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the `admin:org` scope to use this endpoint.
---
---`PUT /orgs/{org}/organization-roles/teams/{team_slug}/{role_id}`
---@param input github.orgs.AssignTeamToOrgRoleRequest
---@return github.orgs.AssignTeamToOrgRoleResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:assign_team_to_org_role(input) end

---Assign an organization role to a user
---
---Assigns an organization role to a member of an organization. For more information on organization roles, see "[Using organization roles](https://docs.github.com/organizations/managing-peoples-access-to-your-organization-with-roles/using-organization-roles)."
---
---The authenticated user must be an administrator for the organization to use this endpoint.
---
---OAuth app tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the `admin:org` scope to use this endpoint.
---
---`PUT /orgs/{org}/organization-roles/users/{username}/{role_id}`
---@param input github.orgs.AssignUserToOrgRoleRequest
---@return github.orgs.AssignUserToOrgRoleResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:assign_user_to_org_role(input) end

---Block a user from an organization
---
---Blocks the given user on behalf of the specified organization and returns a 204. If the organization cannot block the given user a 422 is returned.
---
---`PUT /orgs/{org}/blocks/{username}`
---@param input github.orgs.BlockUserRequest
---@return github.orgs.BlockUserResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:block_user(input) end

---Review requests to access organization resources with fine-grained personal access tokens
---
---Approves or denies multiple pending requests to access organization resources via a fine-grained personal access token.
---
---Only GitHub Apps can use this endpoint.
---
---`POST /orgs/{org}/personal-access-token-requests`
---@param input github.orgs.BulkReviewPatGrantRequestsInRequest
---@return github.orgs.BulkReviewPatGrantRequestsInResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:bulk_review_pat_grant_requests_in(input) end

---Cancel an organization invitation
---
---Cancel an organization invitation. In order to cancel an organization invitation, the authenticated user must be an organization owner.
---
---This endpoint triggers [notifications](https://docs.github.com/github/managing-subscriptions-and-notifications-on-github/about-notifications).
